# Barclays is the day job. Nothing in this folder is committed.
#
# The vault is a git repo; the root CLAUDE.md forbids logging Barclays-internal
# specifics. This is the enforcement layer for that rule, not a substitute for it
# — the rule still applies to every note anywhere in the vault (journals, Plans/,
# wiki/, Progress/), and none of those are covered by this file.
#
# Ignore everything in this directory, but keep this file itself tracked so the
# rule survives a clone.
*
!.gitignore
